      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie\n\n\nSherry FitzGerald Farrell are delighted to present this superb detached home of generous proportions and accommodation, brought to the market in pristine condition and impeccable decorative order and enjoying a tranquil, sylan setting on a spacious 0.42 ha site with most pleasant views of mythical Hill of Sheemore and Sliabh an Iarainn. \n\n\nThis impressive house offers a most pleasant country setting with the amenities of Carrick-on-Shannon, just a 10 minute drive away. \n\nEffrinagh and its environs represents country living at its best with a choice of country walks & hikes to explore & enjoy. Dotted with many small loughs nearby including Annagherly lough, Effrinagh lough & Lowtown, the Shannon Erne Blueway is just a 5km drive with Lock 10 Bar & Grocery, Carr Bia street food, Kellehers Grocery Store, Post Office & Filling Station. \n\nChoice of Primary Schools including Kilnagross N.S. ( 6 min drive), Leitrim Village (9 mins) and Gaelscoil Liatroma ( 8 mins drive). \n\n\nViewing by prior appointment, highly recommended - please contact Liam Farrell on 071-96-20976."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 24.5m2\nPolished porcelain floor tiling, double height feature with impressive oak staircase; composite door and glazed side panel, 'antique' chrome chandelier, lanterain light fitting, radiators x 2, picture wall light, airing cupboard.\n\nSitting room - 4.65m x 4.23m\nWood flooring, open fireplace with ornate surround and granite hearth, bay window feature with bespoke, layered drapes, blinds & tie backs, chrome ceiling light fitting, wall picture light & wall lamps, radiator.\n\nGames Room - 3.95m x 3.44m\nWood flooring, window with blind, radiator, tv point, pendent light fitting.\n\nShower Room - 2.48m x 0.94m\nTiled floor and splashback, wall mirror, chrome & glass shower enclosure with power shower, wc & whb, window with blind.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.34m x 3.19m\nWood flooring, window with chrome pole, drapes & tie backs, radiators, pendent light fitting.\n\nJack & Jill En-Suite - 1.28m x 2.27m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.50m x 3m\nWood flooring, window with drapes, blind & tie backs, radiator.\n\nOpen plan living / kitchen / dining - 7.90m x 3.87m\nPolished porcelain, floor tiling, fitted base and cupboard units with granite worktops, gas hob, Hotpoint double ovens, Whirlpool microwave, Neff integrated dishwasher, fridge freezer. Recessed shelves, 'fireplace' feature with solid fuel range - heats water and radiators, built in cabinets and tiling with oak mantel. Dining area window with curtain pole, drapes, tie backs & blinds.\n\nLiving Area - 3.42m x 3.61m\nHigh floor to ceiling feature, windows with bronze poles, drapes & blinds, candelabra pendant light fittings. French doors with drapes.\n\nUtility Room - 2.44m x 2.16m\nTiled floor, fitted units, plumbed for washers, walk in closet, radiator door with glazed panel.\n\nBathroom - 3m x 2.29m\nFully tiled, jacuzzi bath with chrome mixer tap and hand spray, shower enclosure with Mira Sport Shower, wc & whb, window with blind, radiator, chrome fittings, wall mirror & light.\n\nFirst floor - \nOpen landing area with sitting area 3.23m x 1.65m, carpet, radiator, Velux roof light, 'Antique' candelabra light fitting. Stira stairs acces to roof.\n\nBedroom 3 - 5m x 1.96m\nincluding en-suite , carpet, walk in wardrobe, pendent light fitting.\n\nEnsuite - \nFully tiled, Farko roof light, power shower, wc & whb, wall mirror, radiator.\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.93m x 4.13m\nFarko roof light with blind, carpet, window with drapes & blind, tv point.\n\nBedroom 5 - 15.60m2\nCarpet, window with curtain pole, drapes & blind, radiator.\n\nBathroom - 3.59m x 2.12m\nTiled floor & shower enclosure - rainfall shower with handspray, Farko roof light. Airing cupboard Solar Panels, * O.F.C.H * S.F.C.H * Broadband\n\nExternal - \nLarge site area of 0.42 ha / 1.04 acres with extensive concrete apron to rear, paved patio to side, entrance pairs with flanking walls, large detached garage / workshop with electric roller door & side door. Oil tank, & Oil burner. Solar panels heats domestic water. Site boundary is defined by timber post & rail fencing, beech hedging & natural hedgerows. Extensive lawn areas with beech hedging, shrub planting & gravel beds.\n\nAdditional - \nThese particulars have been prepared by Sherry FitzGerald Farrell and whilst every care has been taken to ensure that these are accurate and correct, we are not responsible for any errors, omissions, inaccuracies, if the property is let, sold or withdrawn from sale or if it is not suitable for your purpose. These particulars are for information only and are given under the strict understanding that they do not form part of any contract. Neither whole nor any part of this document or any reference thereto may be included in any public document, circular or statement nor published without the written consent of Sherry FitzGerald Farrell. PSRA Licence: 003400\n\n"
